{"strongs": "H5982", "word": "עַמּוּד", "translit": "am.mud", "root": "עלק", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "pillar, column", "definition": "עַמּוּד , עַמֻּד 110 noun masculine 1Kgs 7:15 pillar, column ; — עַמּוּד absolute 1Kgs 7:15 +, construct Exod 13:21 +; עַמֻּד absolute Jer 52:21 , construct Num 14:14 suffix עַמּוּדוֺ 2Chr 23:13 plural עַמּוּדִים 1Kgs 7:16 +, less often ׳ עַמֻּ v 1Kgs 7:21 +; construct עַמּוּדֵי Exod 26:32 +, less often ׳ עַמֻּ Exod 38:17 +; suffix עַמּוּדָיו Exod 36:38 +, עַמֻּדָיו Exod 27:10 +, etc.; — 1. pillar , supporting house Judg 16:25 ; Judg 16:26 ; Judg 16:29 pillars in tabernacle Exod 27:10 ; Exod 27:11 ; Exod 27:17 ; Exod 36:38 ; Num 3:37 + 27 t. Exodus, Numbers ( P ), + עַמּוּדֵי שִׁטִּים pillars of acacia wood Exod 26:32 ; Exod 26:37 ; Exod 36:36 pillars in Solomon's palace 1Kgs 7:2 ; 1Kgs 7:3 ; 1Kgs 7:6 , ׳ אוּלָם הָע v 1Kgs 7:6 , עַמּוּדֵי אֲרָזִים v 1Kgs 7:2 pillars of cedar ( P ); in Ezekiel's temple Ezek 42:6 (twice in verse); שֵׁשׁ ׳ ע Esth 1:6 (in palace), Song 5:15 (simile). 2. two bronze pillars — 1Kgs 7:15 ; 2Kgs 25:13 = Jer 52:17 — before temple 1Kgs 7:15 (twice in verse) + 14 t. 1Kgs 7 , + 2Kgs 25:16 ; 2Kgs 25:17 (twice in verse) = Jer 52:20 ; Jer 52:21 (twice in verse), Jer 27:19 ; 1Chr 18:8 ; 2Chr 3:15 ; 2Chr 3:17 + 5 t. Chronicles; perhaps one of these was ׳ הָע by which king stood in temple 2Kgs 11:14 = 2Chr 23:13 ; 2Kgs 23:3 > ׳ ע here = standing-place, platform Thes and others; two pillars before Ezekiel's temple Ezek 40:49 . 3. columns, uprights , of silver Song 3:10 (litter). 4. עָשָׁן ׳ ע Judg 20:40 column of smoke: (הֶ)עָנָן ׳ ע Exod 13:21 ; Exod 13:22 ( J ) + 6 t. J E , hence Neh 9:12 ; Neh 9:19 ; Ps 99:7 || (הָ)אֵשׁ ׳ ע Exod 13:21 ; Exod 13:22 ( J ), Num 14:14 ( J E ), Neh 9:12 ; Neh 9:19 קֵשׁ וְעָנָן ׳ ע Exod 14:24 ( J ), all of the theophanies at time of Exodus. 5. a. בּרזֶל ׳ ע Jer 1:18 (figurative of prophet). \\ \\ b. poetic of pillars of earth Job 9:5 + Job 75:4 , of heaven Job 26:11 . \\ \\ c. of wisdom's house Prov 9:1 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6131')\">BDB6131</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5982')\">H5982</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6130')\">BDB6130</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6132')\">BDB6132</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עַמּוּד</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>עַמֻּד</bdbheb><sub>110</sub> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:15\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,15)\">1Kgs 7:15</ref></sup> <highlightword>pillar, column</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>עַמּוּד</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:15\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,15)\">1Kgs 7:15</ref> +, construct <ref ref=\"Exod 13:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,13,21)\">Exod 13:21</ref> +; <bdbheb>עַמֻּד</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Jer 52:21\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,21)\">Jer 52:21</ref>, construct <ref ref=\"Num 14:14\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(4,14,14)\">Num 14:14</ref> suffix <bdbheb>עַמּוּדוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 23:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,23,13)\">2Chr 23:13</ref> plural <bdbheb>עַמּוּדִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:16\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,16)\">1Kgs 7:16</ref> +, less often <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַמֻּ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:21\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,21)\">1Kgs 7:21</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>עַמּוּדֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 26:32\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(2,26,32)\">Exod 26:32</ref> +, less often <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַמֻּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 38:17\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"17\" onc