vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(2,36,36)\">Exod 36:36</ref> <highlight>pillars</highlight> in Solomon's palace <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:2\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,2)\">1Kgs 7:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:3\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,3)\">1Kgs 7:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:6\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,6)\">1Kgs 7:6</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אוּלָם הָע</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:6\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,6)\">1Kgs 7:6</ref>, <bdbheb>עַמּוּדֵי אֲרָזִים</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:2\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,2)\">1Kgs 7:2</ref> <highlight>pillars of cedar</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); in Ezekiel's temple <ref ref=\"Ezek 42:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,42,6)\">Ezek 42:6</ref> (twice in verse); <bdbheb>שֵׁשׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 1:6\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(17,1,6)\">Esth 1:6</ref> (in palace), <ref ref=\"Song 5:15\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(22,5,15)\">Song 5:15</ref> (simile). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> two bronze pillars — <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:15\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,15)\">1Kgs 7:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,13)\">2Kgs 25:13</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 52:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,17)\">Jer 52:17</ref> — before temple <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:15\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,15)\">1Kgs 7:15</ref> (twice in verse) + 14 t. <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,1)\">1Kgs 7</ref>, + <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:16\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,16)\">2Kgs 25:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:17\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,17)\">2Kgs 25:17</ref> (twice in verse) = <ref ref=\"Jer 52:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,20)\">Jer 52:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 52:21\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,21)\">Jer 52:21</ref> (twice in verse), <ref ref=\"Jer 27:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,27,19)\">Jer 27:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 18:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,18,8)\">1Chr 18:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 3:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,3,15)\">2Chr 3:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 3:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,3,17)\">2Chr 3:17</ref> + 5 t. Chronicles; perhaps one of these was <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הָע</bdbheb> by which king stood in temple <ref ref=\"2Kgs 11:14\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(12,11,14)\">2Kgs 11:14</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 23:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,23,13)\">2Chr 23:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:3\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,3)\">2Kgs 23:3</ref> &gt; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> here = <highlight>standing-place, platform</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup> and others; two pillars before Ezekiel's temple <ref ref=\"Ezek 40:49\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(26,40,49)\">Ezek 40:49</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highl